// The Pataliputra Exchange [INVENTED]. A pretend market in the style of an
// early-1980s trading floor (prices quoted in eighths, ticker tape, telex
// news). Every company, ticker and tie here is INVENTED.
//
// To hook a future character into the market, give the character an id and
// add a tie on any company:  (entity: "char_<id>", on_death: -0.15)
// Their death (event key "death:char_<id>") then moves that stock. Reactions
// below match event keys exactly, or by prefix with a trailing "*".
//
// Event keys the game reports today:
//   death:<governor id>    a governor is killed (any method)
//   removed:<governor id>  a governor leaves office (campaign)
//   method:<quiet_kill|loud_kill|poison|frame|failed>
//   crush                  people die in a panic at a public event
//   alarm                  a compound goes on alarm
//   night                  a night passes in the war room
(
    exchange: "Pataliputra Exchange",
    currency: "pana",
    start_cash: 5000.0,
    tick_seconds: 1.5,
    night_ticks: 40,
    sectors: [
        (id: "steel", name: "Steel & Alloys", drift: 0.00005, volatility: 0.0022),
        (id: "cement", name: "Cement & Building", drift: 0.00008, volatility: 0.0018),
        (id: "tech", name: "Data, Electronics & Telecom", drift: 0.00015, volatility: 0.0035),
